# Send Docker only what the Dockerfile copies. Without this, everything in
# this folder (datasets, sample archives, test output) is uploaded to the
# Docker daemon on every build.
*
!docker-requirements.txt
!defender
!src

# ...and never copy data, samples or the old baseline model into the image
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pkl
**/*.pkl.gz
**/data
**/dataset
**/datasets
**/samples
**/malware
**/goodware
**/benign